    "last_updated": 1758008913,
    "reasons": [
      "This package declares a postinstall script (\"node bundle.js\") that runs arbitrary code during installation while the published \"files\" list does not include bundle.js — a strong indicator of deliberate, hidden execution. The package's purpose (Prettier config) does not justify a postinstall step, it lacks repository/homepage metadata, uses an UNLICENSED license, and has suspicious devDependency choices (including a pinned \"latest\" on a scoped package). Taken together these facts indicate malicious intent to execute hidden code on install; treat as malware and avoid installing without inspecting the tarball."
    ]
